# What a `docker build` sends to the daemon when no Dockerfile-specific ignore
# file applies (BuildKit reads `docker/api.Dockerfile.dockerignore` for the API
# image, which is this file plus `models/`). The Dockerfiles COPY named paths
# only; this keeps the rest out of the context altogether, secrets first.
# `models/` is deliberately not listed here: the reranker image copies its ONNX
# weights from `models/reranker-onnx` (docker/reranker.Dockerfile).

# secrets and local configuration
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
credentials*.json
service-account*.json
.claude

# history and tooling
.git
.github
.gitignore
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.pyright
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.fastembed_cache

# tests and what only they read
tests
docs
demo
scripts
ci
prompts
corpus/golden
corpus/mappings
corpus/instruments/**/raw
db

# local data
data
*.db
*.sqlite
